{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.huaxue.2018a.q23.material.recovered", "text": "某化学教师在一次化学测验中设计了下列计算题，测试后对部分学生的解题过程进行了统计，并选取了典型的解题过程加以分析。 【试题】某钢铁厂每天需消耗5000t含76%的赤铁矿石，该厂理论上可日产含Fe98% 的生铁的质量是多少？ 【考试结果】经统计分析，下列的解题过程具有普遍性。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2018年上半年教师资格证考试《初中化学》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "f575ede7f9cdcf2613f2a35c61fd7b8e7aabfddb9dce35748877285c18dd6e2c", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2403, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2540, "next_source_question_number": 23, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2018年上半年教师资格证考试《初中化学》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 23, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "f575ede7f9cdcf2613f2a35c61fd7b8e7aabfddb9dce35748877285c18dd6e2c"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.huaxue.2018a.q23"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.huaxue.s1.k03", "ntce.chuzhong.huaxue.s4.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.manage", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.307.r001", "ntce.outline.307.r032"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.huaxue.2018a.q23"], "word_count": 137, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "huaxue", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2018年上半年教师资格证考试《初中化学》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2018年上半年教师资格证考试《初中化学》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "f575ede7f9cdcf2613f2a35c61fd7b8e7aabfddb9dce35748877285c18dd6e2c", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2403, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2540, "next_source_question_number": 23, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2018年上半年教师资格证考试《初中化学》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 23, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "f575ede7f9cdcf2613f2a35c61fd7b8e7